    "body": "## Changes\n- Run guest commands directly from installed tools; make Flox optional for bird work and remove obsolete guest upgrade scripts.\n- Fix fresh Kata worker initialization and admission-status reporting.\n- Add delivery_hold for autonomous implementation, fixes, publication recovery, review and QA without admitting merge/delivery.\n- Distinguish a stale pre-push GitHub PR head (retryable) from an unexpected third head (conflict), with actionable errors.\n\n## Verification\n- End-to-end regression covers acknowledged push, stale PR read, terminal turn, dispatcher restart, exact-request automatic recovery without a second push/model call, foreign-head refusal, and delivery selection/action blocking.\n- Focused race tests and go vet pass.\n- Worker/CLI/hostcontrol suite is running; previous startup cleanup suite passed.\n- gh-sweep PR9 has independent Hawk and Wren approvals on 6a3efb7; remains open/unmerged.\n\nStacked on #158. Stop before merge.",
